<title>ESTONIA: C.BANK FIXINGS FOR JULY 10/11.</title>
<headline>C.BANK FIXINGS FOR JULY 10/11.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The central bank on Thursday set</p>
<p>the following exchange rates for July 10/11. The kroon is pegged</p>
<p>at eight kroons to a German mark.</p>
<p>	    July 10/11	 July 9/10</p>
<p>    CZK    0.42731	    0.43246</p>
<p>    DKK    2.09857	    2.1007</p>
<p>    FIM    2.69632	    2.69635</p>
<p>    GBP   23.75715	   23.77297</p>
<p>    HUF    0.07438	    0.07448</p>
<p>    LTL    3.52294	    3.5214</p>
<p>    LVL   24.69114	   24.72242</p>
<p>    RUR    0.00244	    0.00244</p>
<p>    SEK    1.82252	    1.81632</p>
<p>    UAH    7.59712	    7.59229</p>
<p>    USD   14.09		14.0856</p>
<p>    XEU   15.73853	   15.7639</p>
<p>-- Tallinn newsroom, +372 620 9202, reuters@reuters.ee</p>
